==German==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|la|de}} {{m|la|typus||figure, pattern}}. Compare {{cog|fr|type||guy, bloke}}, and {{cog|es|tipo}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|[tyːp]|lang=de}}
* {{audio|De-Typ.ogg|audio|lang=de}}

